Example 1
------------------

Location:
San Rafael, California, United States

Scene:
There is a tree with ripe oranges hanging from its branches. The tree is
against a white wall, and there is a small fountain in front of it. The
fountain has a small bowl on top of it, and there is a small green plant
growing in the bowl. There is also a small bird perched on the edge of
the fountain. A book rests on a table next to the fountain, with the
words "The Lord of the Rings".

Situation:
The date is Wednesday, October 4th 2023.
The time is 10:37 AM.
The weather is: Clouds generally forming or developing during the past hour.
The temperature is 12.2 degrees Celsius.
The season is autumn.
It is daytime.
The elevation is 32.0 meters.

Story:
Will stepped onto the wooden deck and laid down, arms crossed behind his head. He breathed in deeply feeling the warmth of the sun as it beamed down on him. Abigail joined him soon after, laying beside Will. Together they watched as a hawk circled above them; its wings spread wide against a bright blue sky like an exclamation mark in this moment of silence between them both.

Continuation:
As the morning grew cloudy, they rose and walked toward the house. A tree laden with ripe oranges caught Will's eye. Its branches hung low over an old white wall and there was a small fountain in front of it – its bowl filled with dirt and sprouting green plants. A little bird perched on the edge of the fountain as if to welcome them into this beautiful oasis. As they drew closer, Will saw a book: The Lord of the Rings. He breathed in the autumn air and thought of Frodo and his bold adventure beyond the Shire. Maybe Will and Abigail should set out on a new adventure of their own.

